[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Employee referrals provide organizations with an additional talent-sourcing channel by enabling employees to participate actively in the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This capability helps organizations:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand talent reach:&lt;/strong&gt; Access potential candidates through employees' pro (GA: February CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Human Resources

&lt;p&gt;Real-time streaming analytics is built into the new supervisor application. An advanced streaming engine keeps metrics up to date with near-instant updates, allowing supervisors to view the latest data without refreshing the dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key capabilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continu (GA: October CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Contact Center
